@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam roundCorner 14

|Analyst|
start
:Choose a log file;
|Desktop client|
:Recognise the format
and read the frames;
|Analyst|
:Choose the vehicle model;
:Run the analysis;
|Desktop client|
:POST /analyze
(file, model_id);
|Backend|
if (model allowed
offline?) then (no)
  :HTTP 409 with the reason;
  |Desktop client|
  :Show the reason;
  stop
else (yes)
  |Backend|
  :Score every frame with the
  model of its identifier;
  :Count the unresolved frames
  and their reasons;
  :Additional checks,
  merge bursts into alerts;
endif
|Desktop client|
:Show the results
on the Dashboard;
|Analyst|
:Replay the log
in Log Playback;
stop
@enduml
